  "description": {
   "en": "The energetic Kiri who’s in the cheerleading squad knows that Tanizawa from the baseball club hates cheerleaders. To get his approval, Kiri decides to accept Tanizawa’s challenge - at the next baseball match, Kiri has to do a back flip! Also, the Kiri that just became Tanizawa’s exclusive cheerleader is starting to have different feelings towards him…\n\nA series of oneshots, including Best Friend!, Lucky Etc., and Love in Full Bloom!"
